WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.380 --> 01:38.980
[Episode 10]

01:39.230 --> 01:40.130
I disagree with much

01:40.150 --> 01:41.330
of what Changhe said,

01:42.640 --> 01:43.820
but one thing

01:44.790 --> 01:45.690
was no empty talk:

01:47.350 --> 01:48.460
together, the two of us

01:49.120 --> 01:50.290
have never lost.

01:51.230 --> 01:51.850
Eighteen-Sword Array,

01:52.120 --> 01:52.490
Activate!

02:18.240 --> 02:19.260
Great.

02:19.840 --> 02:20.730
Excellent!

02:24.240 --> 02:25.450
Eighteen-Sword Array?

02:26.030 --> 02:27.260
The greatest regret of my life

02:27.310 --> 02:28.100
is

02:28.100 --> 02:29.610
not being born a hundred years earlier

02:30.360 --> 02:31.580
to face the Su family's finest,

02:31.580 --> 02:32.690
Su Shiba, in battle.

02:33.280 --> 02:34.380
Who would've thought that after I was sealed

02:34.430 --> 02:35.200
inside a coffin,

02:35.910 --> 02:37.060
the Su family

02:37.080 --> 02:39.060
would produce another who could revive the Eighteen-Sword Array?

02:39.470 --> 02:40.570
You're so talkative.

02:44.150 --> 02:45.540
I've been trapped in that coffin

02:45.590 --> 02:46.690
for so many years,

02:47.430 --> 02:49.010
of course, I have much to say

02:49.710 --> 02:51.100
and many fights yet to fight.

02:58.000 --> 03:00.060
These swords of yours aren't enough to take me down.

03:00.560 --> 03:01.340
Show me

03:01.400 --> 03:02.410
your true strike.

03:02.910 --> 03:03.820
Then I'll grant your wish.

03:25.800 --> 03:26.690
Drizzle Sword.

03:32.680 --> 03:33.220
What's that?

03:34.150 --> 03:35.340
He's absorbing my sword energy.

03:35.700 --> 03:36.400
So

03:36.680 --> 03:38.290
this is what makes Hell Palm so terrifying.

04:28.070 --> 04:28.780
What a fool.

04:29.510 --> 04:30.950
You've got some nerve to use your palm against me.

04:31.560 --> 04:32.710
Open your eyes wide

04:32.710 --> 04:33.740
to see who the real fool is.

04:38.950 --> 04:39.490
Changhe.

04:46.870 --> 04:48.050
I didn't know

04:48.560 --> 04:49.580
that besides me,

04:49.630 --> 04:50.810
there was someone in the Blood River

04:51.000 --> 04:51.900
bold enough

04:51.950 --> 04:53.140
to defy the rules.

04:54.830 --> 04:56.660
You've been secretly practicing the Hell Palm.

04:57.160 --> 04:58.220
Secretly?

04:59.310 --> 05:00.730
Judging from how things turned out,

05:01.680 --> 05:03.140
I'd say I was just early to start.

05:11.120 --> 05:12.490
What a shame.

05:13.070 --> 05:14.220
If your cultivation in the Hell Palm

05:14.270 --> 05:15.610
were one level higher,

05:15.830 --> 05:17.100
you could've beaten me.

05:17.720 --> 05:18.660
But alas.

05:19.040 --> 05:20.340
The Ten Courts of Hell

05:20.920 --> 05:22.610
each rule over life and death.

05:23.160 --> 05:23.780
You're

05:25.920 --> 05:28.290
one step short.

05:40.920 --> 05:41.580
Darn it.

05:42.120 --> 05:43.730
How can a man who just crawled out of a coffin

05:44.120 --> 05:45.290
have such profound inner force?

05:59.130 --> 06:00.040
I looked pathetic.

06:01.070 --> 06:01.540
Changhe,

06:02.680 --> 06:03.760
do you really mean to lead them

06:03.760 --> 06:04.540
to the other shore?

06:05.040 --> 06:05.540
Of course,

06:06.270 --> 06:08.220
even though this is only the beginning.

06:09.310 --> 06:10.050
I've always been the only one

06:10.800 --> 06:12.140
who prefers to stay away from strife.

06:12.950 --> 06:14.020
Since this is fate's will,

06:15.480 --> 06:16.850
I'll sever it with my sword.

06:19.600 --> 06:20.580
Hold the Dormant Dragon Sword

06:21.430 --> 06:22.100
and become the first

06:22.950 --> 06:23.900
Patriarch

06:23.950 --> 06:25.140
as a Nameless.

06:25.600 --> 06:26.660
You finally came around.

06:27.800 --> 06:29.020
We were born

06:29.070 --> 06:30.220
to fight our fate.

06:30.920 --> 06:32.220
If you wish to wield the sword, then let's do it.

06:32.870 --> 06:33.340
Only death

06:34.000 --> 06:34.540
can stop us.

06:40.270 --> 06:41.810
I'll find you an opening to wield that sword.

06:42.240 --> 06:43.050
Such arrogance.

06:52.600 --> 06:53.020
Yue'an,

06:53.720 --> 06:55.580
if you only have one chance to strike,

06:58.310 --> 06:59.340
close your eyes,

07:00.000 --> 07:01.140
and trust the judgment

07:01.720 --> 07:03.460
you're most certain of in that moment.

07:21.830 --> 07:22.410
Su Muyu,

07:23.070 --> 07:24.020
I can't hold on anymore!

07:49.160 --> 07:49.730
I'm running out of strength.

07:57.560 --> 07:58.410
That slash

07:59.310 --> 08:00.290
damaged your heart meridian.

08:01.120 --> 08:02.100
If you keep insisting,

08:03.310 --> 08:04.140
you'll die.

08:05.160 --> 08:06.340
You two...

08:09.750 --> 08:11.100
What were your names again?

08:12.120 --> 08:12.810
Su Muyu.

08:16.950 --> 08:18.250
I'm Su Changhe.

08:20.240 --> 08:21.170
Very good.

08:22.560 --> 08:23.610
Your names

08:23.680 --> 08:25.220
will be known across the land.

08:28.240 --> 08:29.850
We'll meet again.

08:35.080 --> 08:35.980
Very good.

08:36.750 --> 08:37.490
You two

08:37.510 --> 08:38.980
are indeed impressive.

08:39.600 --> 08:41.490
I'll look forward

08:42.320 --> 08:43.220
to our next encounter.

08:52.750 --> 08:53.300
Su Muyu,

08:54.320 --> 08:55.510
if you really want to quit,

08:56.150 --> 08:57.350
the promise we made before

08:57.600 --> 08:58.250
doesn't stand anymore.

08:59.360 --> 09:01.020
As for the powers behind all this that you mentioned,

09:01.720 --> 09:02.420
I'll root them out

09:02.630 --> 09:04.140
in no time.

09:11.510 --> 09:11.980
Alright.

09:12.960 --> 09:14.850
That being said, the Hell Palm is too dangerous.

09:15.960 --> 09:16.850
One slip,

09:17.390 --> 09:18.720
and it could backfire on you.

09:20.030 --> 09:21.370
You ought to be extra careful.

09:23.670 --> 09:25.180
It's not easy

09:25.670 --> 09:26.530
for us to have come this far.

09:28.200 --> 09:28.700
But

09:29.320 --> 09:30.770
I'll keep moving forward.

09:33.080 --> 09:33.730
Changhe...

09:34.270 --> 09:35.250
I know what you're going to say.

09:37.080 --> 09:38.220
I'll announce to the world,

09:39.000 --> 09:39.770
from today on,

09:40.790 --> 09:41.980
there'll be no more Umbrella Ghost in the Blood River.

09:43.390 --> 09:44.460
I'll destroy the Soul Reapers' Hall,

09:45.200 --> 09:46.100
so no one

09:46.120 --> 09:47.340
can ever issue another writ to kill you again.

09:48.080 --> 09:49.490
As well as the family

09:49.750 --> 09:50.340
you wish to take with you.

09:53.510 --> 09:54.650
You once said you liked Nan'an.

09:55.630 --> 09:57.410
I bought a mansion there

09:58.240 --> 10:00.120
with the savings I stashed away over the years.

10:01.000 --> 10:02.420
Go to Nan'an and find

10:02.510 --> 10:04.000
the owner of Shouyue Banking House.

10:04.360 --> 10:05.470
He'll give you the deed.

10:06.360 --> 10:07.420
There are ten thousand taels of silver

10:07.440 --> 10:08.460
buried under the courtyard.

10:09.080 --> 10:09.940
If you run out of money,

10:10.030 --> 10:10.580
dig it up.

10:11.630 --> 10:12.730
Every autumn...

10:23.600 --> 10:24.770
Every autumn,

10:25.440 --> 10:27.420
when osmanthus fills Nan'an City,

10:28.390 --> 10:29.370
I'll come find you for a drink.

10:31.150 --> 10:31.580
Of course,

10:32.670 --> 10:33.820
if you'd rather no one,

10:34.670 --> 10:36.300
including me, know where you are,

10:37.670 --> 10:39.010
you can sell the mansion back

10:39.670 --> 10:41.730
to the Shouyue Banking House.

10:43.550 --> 10:44.060
Still,

10:45.150 --> 10:46.010
every autumn,

10:48.150 --> 10:49.580
when osmanthus fills Nan'an City,

10:55.360 --> 10:57.250
I'll hope to see you again.

11:01.750 --> 11:02.370
Changhe.

11:12.870 --> 11:14.250
You never belonged here.

11:15.080 --> 11:16.100
Leaving this place is what you were meant to do.

11:17.630 --> 11:18.300
As for me,

11:19.840 --> 11:21.850
I crawled out from piles of dead bodies when I was a child.

11:23.390 --> 11:24.770
To me, life

11:26.030 --> 11:27.770
was never worth much.

11:28.960 --> 11:29.820
If I leave,

11:32.600 --> 11:33.820
I wouldn't even know where to go.

11:37.360 --> 11:38.980
But you're a fool, really.

11:40.360 --> 11:41.370
You hate killing,

11:41.720 --> 11:42.850
yet it's the only thing you're good at.

11:43.320 --> 11:44.250
You know nothing else.

11:45.030 --> 11:46.300
You've been the Kui for years,

11:46.600 --> 11:48.100
and you're still broke.

11:49.270 --> 11:50.730
If you lived in the mortal world,

11:51.320 --> 11:52.460
you'd definitely be cheated.

12:07.320 --> 12:07.850
Farewell.

12:11.200 --> 12:11.850
Su Muyu.

12:24.550 --> 12:25.250
You call me a fool.

12:27.910 --> 12:29.100
You're just as much of a fool.

12:31.120 --> 12:32.580
Remember we went to Luohe City

12:33.390 --> 12:34.340
on our first mission

12:34.390 --> 12:36.180
to kill Li Huan, the one who embezzled relief funds?

12:36.600 --> 12:38.530
We could've finished him with one strike,

12:39.150 --> 12:40.790
but you insisted on tracing the clues

12:41.080 --> 12:42.000
and took

12:42.000 --> 12:43.700
all his money and valuables.

12:44.550 --> 12:45.300
And what happened?

12:46.320 --> 12:47.340
We were surrounded

12:47.340 --> 12:48.670
by 32 constables from the Six Gates Bureau

12:48.840 --> 12:50.610
and nearly died in his mansion.

12:51.320 --> 12:51.940
That's because...

12:52.150 --> 12:52.700
Shut up.

12:57.080 --> 12:57.730
And that time

12:58.550 --> 12:59.850
at Xuehe Manor,

12:59.910 --> 13:00.890
when we went after the Sword Ghost, Wang Ba.

13:01.480 --> 13:03.300
You just had to sneak into his library,

13:03.840 --> 13:04.900
saying you wanted to collect some martial arts manuals,

13:05.510 --> 13:06.990
and we ended up trapped by his mechanisms.

13:07.630 --> 13:08.630
Luckily, I had

13:08.630 --> 13:09.820
some food on me,

13:10.320 --> 13:12.100
and we managed to last three days and three nights

13:12.150 --> 13:12.980
before reinforcements arrived.

13:13.670 --> 13:14.850
Otherwise, we would've starved to death.

13:16.270 --> 13:17.340
We didn't die, did we?

13:17.360 --> 13:18.300
And what happened at Lingnan,

13:18.600 --> 13:19.400
the East Sea,

13:19.400 --> 13:20.300
and the Lei Fortress.

13:21.120 --> 13:22.180
Every time, you turned

13:22.200 --> 13:22.890
a simple task

13:22.910 --> 13:24.250
into a mess of trouble.

13:25.080 --> 13:26.180
If you ever became the Patriarch,

13:27.200 --> 13:28.250
your greed and ambition

13:28.270 --> 13:29.530
would surge like the tide

13:29.870 --> 13:31.180
and drown everyone

13:31.200 --> 13:32.650
who followed you.

13:34.790 --> 13:35.700
You'd only become a madman

13:36.870 --> 13:38.060
without restraint.

13:40.150 --> 13:40.730
So

13:43.550 --> 13:45.250
I'll calm the storm with you.

13:47.600 --> 13:48.700
The old promise still counts,

13:50.030 --> 13:51.130
but we'll switch our roles.

13:52.670 --> 13:53.250
Su Changhe,

13:54.550 --> 13:55.180
once we get out of here,

13:56.630 --> 13:57.770
you'll be the Patriarch,

13:58.750 --> 13:59.650
and I'll lead the Su family.

14:06.120 --> 14:06.730
I'll be with you.

14:08.910 --> 14:09.850
We'll bring forth

14:09.870 --> 14:10.610
a new Blood River.

14:12.510 --> 14:12.980
All right.

14:18.510 --> 14:19.890
Just like back at the Wailing Abyss.

14:21.910 --> 14:22.890
Only that time,

14:25.720 --> 14:26.610
it was you holding me up.

14:28.540 --> 14:31.300
♪Just one line...♪

14:33.000 --> 14:33.890
Some debts

14:36.390 --> 14:37.250
always have to be repaid.

14:38.300 --> 14:44.140
♪Mountains and rivers meet and apart, it's you that I rely on...♪

14:45.320 --> 14:45.940
To be honest,

14:47.630 --> 14:48.820
till the very end,

14:50.240 --> 14:51.460
I still didn't think you'd stay.

14:52.420 --> 14:58.980
♪This weary journey finds its end, only because♪

14:59.100 --> 15:01.900
♪I'm lucky to meet you♪

15:10.270 --> 15:11.100
Back then,

15:12.270 --> 15:15.130
Sikong Changfeng, third city lord of Xueyue City,

15:16.840 --> 15:18.100
shattered the Lone Void Array spanning a hundred li

15:18.120 --> 15:19.770
with a single thrust of his spear.

15:21.120 --> 15:22.060
I suppose

15:22.750 --> 15:24.490
his power must've been immeasurable.

15:25.910 --> 15:27.570
But when I swung my sword,

15:27.630 --> 15:30.250
I could only clear the space three chi before me.

15:31.790 --> 15:32.650
This really is

15:34.150 --> 15:36.130
a tough fight.

15:41.000 --> 15:42.010
Mu Zizhe got away.

15:42.390 --> 15:43.250
The remaining disciples of the Mu

15:43.480 --> 15:44.130
and Xie families

15:44.270 --> 15:45.060
have all surrendered.

16:05.440 --> 16:07.820
What exactly is going on?

16:08.720 --> 16:10.820
The Three Families are history now.

16:11.720 --> 16:13.060
The new Blood River

16:14.030 --> 16:15.940
is about to reach the other shore.

16:38.320 --> 16:40.060
Regroup with Su Changhe.

16:44.790 --> 16:45.700
Well, I'm old.

16:46.080 --> 16:47.420
When it comes to scheming against the human heart,

16:47.870 --> 16:49.060
Su Changhe really

16:49.390 --> 16:50.700
leaves nothing to chance.

17:03.390 --> 17:05.770
You made a horrible decision,

17:06.510 --> 17:07.700
Sir.

17:11.440 --> 17:14.380
I'm not the Patriarch anymore.

17:16.750 --> 17:18.490
I once bore the surname Mu

17:19.550 --> 17:20.770
and Su,

17:22.480 --> 17:25.090
yet I can never really leave this river.

17:26.110 --> 17:27.660
Perhaps this upheaval

17:29.110 --> 17:31.010
could bring forth a new Blood River

17:31.830 --> 17:33.810
and become

17:35.160 --> 17:36.180
a different shadow

17:37.550 --> 17:38.620
in this world.

17:41.440 --> 17:42.730
Naive.

17:44.030 --> 17:44.860
A shadow

17:45.200 --> 17:46.660
is still a shadow.

17:48.510 --> 17:50.660
It can never go somewhere bright.

17:51.920 --> 17:53.330
Then I shall see for myself.

17:55.350 --> 17:56.530
But, Sir,

17:57.720 --> 17:59.290
whatever the outcome,

18:04.640 --> 18:06.530
you won't get to see it.

18:11.510 --> 18:12.930
I, Su Changhe, from the Su family,

18:13.440 --> 18:15.130
have gained the current Patriarch's approval

18:16.240 --> 18:17.180
and been granted the Dormant Dragon Sword.

18:18.310 --> 18:19.180
From this day forward,

18:20.200 --> 18:21.810
I'll assume the position of Patriarch of the Blood River.

18:36.830 --> 18:38.050
Greetings to the new Patriarch,

18:38.790 --> 18:39.570
Su Changhe.

18:48.510 --> 18:50.010
Greetings, Sir.

19:07.310 --> 19:08.460
The leader of Spider Shadow, Su Muyu,

19:09.030 --> 19:09.980
will step down from the title of Kui.

19:10.920 --> 19:11.330
He is now

19:12.000 --> 19:13.050
the head of the Su family.

19:16.270 --> 19:16.810
Everyone,

19:18.240 --> 19:19.140
the new Blood River

19:20.350 --> 19:21.250
has arrived.

19:23.960 --> 19:25.420
Greetings, Sir.

19:25.720 --> 19:27.620
Greetings, Master Su.

19:46.750 --> 19:47.290
Tang Lianyue.

20:07.000 --> 20:07.700
Tang Lianyue.

20:10.140 --> 20:17.220
[Yi's Residence]

20:33.620 --> 20:36.620
[Yi Bu, Shadow Sect]

20:37.030 --> 20:38.010
Seems like

20:38.010 --> 20:39.000
[Xiao Yong, First Prince]

20:39.000 --> 20:39.770
this game

20:40.350 --> 20:41.460
is already lost.

20:44.750 --> 20:46.570
That's too early to say.

20:48.550 --> 20:49.490
Fair enough.

20:51.240 --> 20:52.330
Who knows,

20:53.160 --> 20:54.420
there might be a divine move

20:55.200 --> 20:56.420
that rose from despair.

21:03.400 --> 21:03.940
Sir.

21:10.820 --> 21:11.680
[The Blood River's internal strife has ended. Mu Mingce and Xie Ba were killed.]

21:11.680 --> 21:12.380
[Su Jinhui and Mu Zizhe went missing.]

21:12.380 --> 21:12.880
[Su Changhe became the new Patriarch.]

21:12.880 --> 21:13.780
[Su Muyu, Mu Qingyang, and Xie Qidao became the new family heads.]

21:20.310 --> 21:22.730
It seems the one

21:22.830 --> 21:23.860
who's truly playing against you

21:26.590 --> 21:28.050
has made his own

21:28.590 --> 21:29.940
divine move.

21:34.790 --> 21:36.140
These two young men

21:37.200 --> 21:37.860
actually...

21:43.400 --> 21:46.050
Perhaps this is the best ending after all.

21:48.030 --> 21:48.570
Why

21:49.510 --> 21:50.660
is that so?

21:52.160 --> 21:53.660
Because they are strong.

21:55.750 --> 21:57.620
Only a powerful rival

21:58.200 --> 21:59.570
can be

22:00.240 --> 22:01.810
the ally we now need.

22:09.500 --> 22:12.740
[Nan'an City]

22:13.740 --> 22:15.140
[It's Grain Rain today.]

22:15.140 --> 22:18.540
[It marks the end of spring. The rain falls as affection grows deeper.]

22:21.400 --> 22:22.050
Hold it steady.

22:33.680 --> 22:34.400
Excuse me, miss.

22:34.480 --> 22:35.450
I'd like one jin of osmanthus cake.

22:36.160 --> 22:36.810
One jin...

22:37.110 --> 22:38.220
One jin of osmanthus cake?

22:38.640 --> 22:40.260
Yes, one jin of osmanthus cake.

22:41.210 --> 22:41.660
All right.

22:53.880 --> 22:54.720
Here's your osmanthus cake.

22:57.720 --> 22:58.250
Thank you.

23:29.480 --> 23:30.730
I'm back, Miss Bai.

23:37.400 --> 23:38.530
I'm so tired.

23:39.750 --> 23:40.250
Later,

23:40.270 --> 23:41.570
when the medicine cools a little,

23:41.640 --> 23:42.810
drink it all.

23:42.920 --> 23:43.740
Not a drop left.

23:43.790 --> 23:44.250
All right?

23:45.110 --> 23:46.330
All right, Miss Bai.

23:54.880 --> 23:55.620
It's still hot.

24:13.400 --> 24:14.660
More patients have come today.

24:15.000 --> 24:16.380
It's the Grain Rain season.

24:16.510 --> 24:18.010
The spring wind stirs the heart.

24:20.110 --> 24:20.980
It's easy to fall ill.

24:21.550 --> 24:22.140
What kind of illness?

24:23.880 --> 24:25.010
When the heart is stirred,

24:25.480 --> 24:26.660
it's lovesickness.

24:33.640 --> 24:35.090
The person you wanted to see is here.

24:36.590 --> 24:37.980
And the osmanthus cake I wanted to eat,

24:38.200 --> 24:39.010
I got it.

24:41.000 --> 24:42.290
Let's begin

24:42.310 --> 24:43.030
the consultations.

24:43.750 --> 24:44.330
It starts now.

24:44.880 --> 24:46.050
Coming.

24:53.720 --> 24:54.330
What seems to be the problem?

24:56.350 --> 24:56.900
Your hand.

25:04.880 --> 25:05.660
What's your ailment?

25:07.310 --> 25:09.180
Isn't that why I came

25:09.920 --> 25:11.620
to find out what ailment it is?

25:15.680 --> 25:16.490
Ten taels of silver.

25:17.110 --> 25:17.940
I'll have him

25:18.350 --> 25:19.420
prepare your concoction.

25:19.960 --> 25:20.700
What concoction?

25:25.980 --> 25:27.740
[One tael of woad root]

25:31.510 --> 25:32.220
Ten taels of silver.

25:33.680 --> 25:34.660
Ten taels of silver

25:34.790 --> 25:35.770
for one tael of woad root?

25:35.790 --> 25:36.660
If you don't want it,

25:37.110 --> 25:38.040
I'll give it to someone else.

25:39.070 --> 25:39.730
I'll take it. I will.

25:46.310 --> 25:46.980
Next, please.

25:49.310 --> 25:50.490
Why are there still so many in line?

25:50.590 --> 25:51.250
Tell me about it.

25:51.550 --> 25:52.250
Which number is she?

25:53.240 --> 25:54.010
I'll pay a hundred taels.

25:54.240 --> 25:55.350
I want him to feed me the medicine.

25:57.440 --> 25:58.980
[One hundred taels]
One hundred taels?

26:00.000 --> 26:00.880
One hundred taels isn't enough.

26:01.880 --> 26:02.380
Two hundred taels.

26:03.640 --> 26:04.160
Deal.

26:14.500 --> 26:15.460
[A hundred taels]

26:18.240 --> 26:18.860
Next, please.

26:28.590 --> 26:29.560
Stop staring.

26:29.750 --> 26:30.860
Your condition is serious.

26:31.310 --> 26:32.220
Look at me

26:32.400 --> 26:33.140
and listen carefully.

26:34.070 --> 26:34.620
Otherwise,

26:35.310 --> 26:36.660
you won't make it through this spring.

26:40.500 --> 26:44.260
[Yi's Residence]

26:46.110 --> 26:47.380
After Su Muyu succeeded

26:47.440 --> 26:49.220
as head of the Su family,

26:49.640 --> 26:51.490
he opened an apothecary in Nan'an City?

26:52.400 --> 26:52.770
Yes.

26:53.880 --> 26:55.050
We sent people to keep watch,

26:55.880 --> 26:56.700
but they were discovered.

26:57.640 --> 26:58.330
Someone intervened

26:58.350 --> 26:59.490
and crippled their martial skills.

27:00.200 --> 27:01.900
It seems to be a warning.

27:03.240 --> 27:04.050
We've only posted

27:04.510 --> 27:05.420
a few watchers

27:05.480 --> 27:06.380
outside Nan'an City now.

27:07.270 --> 27:08.420
We have no idea

27:08.480 --> 27:09.250
what they're up to.

27:10.920 --> 27:11.940
What about Su Changhe?

27:12.510 --> 27:13.380
He returned to Blood River.

27:14.030 --> 27:14.860
Judging by his moves,

27:15.550 --> 27:16.810
he's after the Soul Reapers' Hall.

27:17.880 --> 27:19.180
But the Three Officials have left.

27:20.070 --> 27:22.090
He took in the disciples from the Three Families who remained in Blood River,

27:22.750 --> 27:23.620
and then left.

27:27.200 --> 27:28.250
Send a message to the Three Officials.

27:29.680 --> 27:31.380
Now is the time

27:31.440 --> 27:32.530
they meet.

27:34.000 --> 27:34.460
Sir,

27:35.790 --> 27:37.090
is this to form an alliance with them?

27:37.680 --> 27:39.140
Even though an unruly sword

27:39.880 --> 27:41.290
is hard to control,

27:44.680 --> 27:46.330
if we hold it in our hands,

27:47.350 --> 27:49.770
only then can we achieve true domination.

27:52.480 --> 27:53.810
Your Eighteen-Sword Array

27:54.510 --> 27:55.530
is amazing.

27:56.000 --> 27:57.000
I could sense your sword aura

27:57.160 --> 27:58.770
from a distance.

27:59.720 --> 28:01.200
But how will you retrieve

28:01.400 --> 28:02.420
the swords you release?

28:02.720 --> 28:03.660
Changhe had the Ban family

28:04.160 --> 28:05.570
specially make this umbrella

28:05.590 --> 28:06.420
for me.

28:06.960 --> 28:08.730
Back then, when I launched the Eighteen-Sword Array,

28:09.110 --> 28:10.460
I used ordinary paper umbrellas.

28:10.960 --> 28:11.730
They broke easily,

28:12.070 --> 28:12.980
and after each launch,

28:13.480 --> 28:14.860
I had to gather the swords myself.

28:53.160 --> 28:53.980
Honestly,

28:54.790 --> 28:56.380
if you ever have to use

28:56.400 --> 28:57.730
this sword array to attack in the future,

28:58.200 --> 28:59.180
wouldn't you have to

28:59.200 --> 29:00.420
pull the swords

29:00.550 --> 29:01.380
out of each body?

29:02.350 --> 29:03.810
There's no assassin in the world who would do that.

29:05.920 --> 29:07.440
As long as the mission is completed.

29:07.590 --> 29:08.720
They're dead,

29:09.030 --> 29:10.770
they won't see me gathering the swords.

29:12.200 --> 29:12.900
I'll take more jobs

29:13.200 --> 29:14.490
and save up

29:15.070 --> 29:16.940
to buy you a decent umbrella.

29:17.510 --> 29:18.460
Otherwise, partnering with you

29:18.480 --> 29:19.180
on a killing mission

29:19.680 --> 29:20.490
would be too embarrassing.

29:21.240 --> 29:21.660
Here.

29:24.070 --> 29:24.800
All right.

29:25.830 --> 29:26.730
Thank you.

29:27.270 --> 29:28.190
You're so kind.

29:29.720 --> 29:30.570
Changhe said

29:31.270 --> 29:32.290
an assassin shouldn't look like that

29:32.310 --> 29:33.730
after a kill.

29:42.440 --> 29:43.940
This is just a sword.

29:45.110 --> 29:46.700
Why must one possess it

29:47.270 --> 29:48.530
to rule Blood River?

30:22.020 --> 30:25.500
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

30:25.540 --> 30:29.420
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

30:31.260 --> 30:34.740
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

30:34.780 --> 30:38.620
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

30:40.620 --> 30:43.900
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

30:44.020 --> 30:46.100
♪Still I can't let go♪

30:46.260 --> 30:49.700
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

30:50.180 --> 30:52.380
♪My heart no longer my own♪

30:52.500 --> 30:57.500
♪No one can escape from love♪

31:14.100 --> 31:17.820
♪How many hidden feelings♪

31:17.940 --> 31:22.020
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

31:23.260 --> 31:27.140
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

31:27.260 --> 31:31.500
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

31:32.620 --> 31:35.500
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

31:35.580 --> 31:39.820
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

31:42.100 --> 31:46.100
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

31:46.140 --> 31:49.580
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

31:51.100 --> 31:54.540
